        <p class="rv"><!--E:home.94|The Company|Paragraph-->Dateen began in 2007 as <strong>Jom Makan Place</strong>, a neighbourhood kitchen operating on homemade recipes. Demand from nearby offices led to a structured corporate catering operation, eventually scaling to feed hundreds while maintaining consistency across every order.<!--/E--></p>
        <p class="rv"><!--E:home.95|The Company|Paragraph-->In <strong>2024</strong>, the business joined Gourmet Nation Sdn Bhd, formalising procurement relationships with larger corporate clients while preserving the recipes and standards that established the brand.<!--/E--></p>
